# Check out LF everywhere — Windows checkouts under autocrlf produced CRLF
# working trees, which made Prettier (endOfLine: lf) flag every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never eol-converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
# The v0.7.1 upgrade fixture's Hub archive of record (#348): a real SQLite file,
# generated byte-for-byte by build-upgrade-fixture.ts. Under `* text=auto eol=lf`
# a Windows checkout would mangle every 0x0D it happens to contain.
*.sqlite binary
